    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        223.16912841796875,
        526.9589233398438,
        236.3141326904297
      ],
      "text": "concurrent testing versus LC-aNAAT alone were 6.7% (95% credible interval [CrI]: 3.8 to 10.7;",
