        70.86609649658203,
        238.66912841796875,
        526.8135986328125,
        251.8141326904297
      ],
      "text": "95% prediction interval [PI]: 0.6 to 45.9) and –6.8% (95% CrI: –9.5 to –4.7; 95% PI: –32.8 to –6.8),",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.946218490600586,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        254.16912841796875,
        513.6306762695312,
        267.31414794921875
      ],
      "text": "respectively ( ). Certainty of evidence was low for both sensitivity and specificity. Fig. 2.3.1.1",
