        526.4922485351562,
        595.9050903320312
      ],
      "text": "CrI: credible interval; CRS: composite reference standard; LC-aNAAT: low-complexity automated nucleic acid",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        595.9501342773438,
        526.5003051757812,
        606.705078125
      ],
      "text": "amplification test; LF-LAM: lateral flow urine lipoarabinomannan assay; MRS: microbiological reference standard;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        606.7501220703125,
        135.74710083007812,
        617.5050659179688
      ],
      "text": "TB: tuberculosis.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        620.3689575195312,
        526.4973754882812,
        631.1397705078125
      ],
      "text": "a  The diamonds represent the pooled sensitivity and specificity, and the black horizontal line its 95% CrI. The",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        631.184814453125,
        526.5012817382812,
        641.9397583007812
      ],
      "text": "pooled difference in sensitivity and specificity between concurrent testing and LC-aNAAT alone is indicated by a",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        641.98486328125,
        526.5012817382812,
        652.7398071289062
      ],
      "text": "line connecting two diamonds. This pooled difference may not correspond to the difference between the pooled",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        652.7847290039062,
        279.98687744140625,
        663.5396728515625
      ],
      "text": "single test accuracy estimates (see  ). Web Annex B.8",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        680.5479736328125,
        526.9810180664062,
        693.6929931640625
      ],
      "text": "In addition to diagnostic accuracy, clinical outcome data on mortality, time to diagnosis and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        696.0479736328125,
        527.0250854492188,
        709.1929931640625
      ],
      "text": "time to treatment were assessed. Data on cure and loss to follow-up were not assessed due to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        711.5480346679688,
        526.9808349609375,
        724.6930541992188
      ],
      "text": "a lack of data. The data from three studies indicated that an intervention including LC-aNAAT",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        727.0480346679688,
        526.9976806640625,
        740.1930541992188
      ],
      "text": "on respiratory samples and LF-LAM on urine in adult inpatients with HIV was associated with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        742.5480346679688,
        526.651123046875,
        755.6930541992188
      ],
      "text": "slightly reduced 8-week mortality (risk ratio: 0.93; 95% CI: 0.74–1.17). The adjusted hazard",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        758.0480346679688,
        527.0863037109375,
        771.1930541992188
      ],
      "text": "ratio of time to diagnosis in adult inpatients with HIV was 1.55 (95% CI: 1.29–1.87). This means",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.983137130737305,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        353.2680969238281,
